uestion/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "97d72a17-2281-52f3-a3f9-d658f3c735d4" :question/math-academy-id "q-157224" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-2{a}_{1}-{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3}=0.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{a}_{1}-{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3} & =-2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-2+0 \\\\ 0+4+0 \\\\ 2-2+15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=0 \\\\ -4{x}_{2} &=0 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=0 \\\\ -4{x}_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is true. Since statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true, the set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$”; “The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275382 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "450fa0a5-918f-5572-9d4e-0b23223efc3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449744} {:answer/id #uuid "23cf3255-62a9-50d7-83d5-aad80f2be23e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449745}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "450fa0a5-918f-5572-9d4e-0b23223efc3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449744} :answer-field/id #uuid "0e12d85f-e55d-5d26-8fa7-a1c3fe6525fb" :answer-field/key "${a}_{1}-5{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450826} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76952045-4272-5683-a72d-0d539b0d0ea9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449746} {:answer/id #uuid "59df24fa-d195-5cce-8336-25ea10186942" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "59df24fa-d195-5cce-8336-25ea10186942" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449747} :answer-field/id #uuid "9b14a133-075b-551e-91bc-74ee67241348" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450827} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d3a43103-bf7b-525c-95cb-71da87d6c0ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449748} {:answer/id #uuid "69f5f534-bfae-593c-81fc-b32117697d1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3a43103-bf7b-525c-95cb-71da87d6c0ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449748} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3618720-e80e-5dc7-a706-380306c42caa" :answer-field/key "The set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450828}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "3b60b8aa-49bb-5ecd-ad04-b68a0c43f769" :question/math-academy-id "q-157225" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${a}_{1}-5{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3}=0.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1}-5{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -20\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+0+0 \\\\ 5+0-9 \\\\ -2-20+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -19\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} &=0 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\n- Statement “The set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true, the set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275383 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} {:answer/id #uuid "ec3f999c-abdd-5a87-9204-4b13bfc2361d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c0d7ec0-7274-56ea-8e17-5dc902e217cf" :answer-field/key "$-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}+5{a}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450829} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c2d0dc78-91a3-5567-80a0-214fb535e9ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449752} {:answer/id #uuid "7ce350bd-6e6f-54e0-816d-4d9658486f5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449753}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ce350bd-6e6f-54e0-816d-4d9658486f5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449753} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e6ab5e6-2163-5059-b629-4a9cdb0438ae" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450830} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "600ee484-c8fb-5632-bd7d-a01ccab65fb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449754} {:answer/id #uuid "59b8d6b2-3c00-5485-ba17-2f8c3aead6f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449755}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "600ee484-c8fb-5632-bd7d-a01ccab65fb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449754} :answer-field/id #uuid "deb701d3-fb26-5305-8568-d564a14ef228" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450831}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "40a86374-09c1-5fcd-a58c-a5f678fb3c1d" :question/math-academy-id "q-157228" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}+5{a}_{3}=0.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}+5{a}_{3} & =-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+5\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ 20 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2+0+15 \\\\ -7-10+20 \\\\ 0+0+5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 7{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true, the set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275384 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb3566f6-5648-5ded-a3f6-a1f68bddbb41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449756} {:answer/id #uuid "dc5d08b2-9024-5b11-99ac-9eb20963ee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc5d08b2-9024-5b11-99ac-9eb20963ee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449757} :answer-field/id #uuid "e73a4373-d621-5f35-a808-178c8861a82d" :answer-field/key "${a}_{1}-3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450832} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "39303f9a-ace3-5e34-bf37-934e599096fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449758} {:answer/id #uuid "1472f8c2-9b6a-5097-9017-33f0242406ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449759}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39303f9a-ace3-5e34-bf37-934e599096fe" :answ