tors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${a}_{1}-3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=0.$ is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1}-3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-3+4 \\\\ 5-6+1 \\\\ 2-12+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is false. Since statement ${a}_{1}-3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=0.$ is true, we have ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ for ${x}_{1}={x}_{3}=1$ and ${x}_{2}=-3.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is false, the set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${a}_{1}-3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=0.$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275385 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2254be2b-f993-5682-a9c7-9d6c1aa8a420" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449762} {:answer/id #uuid "b8837dad-34d4-5dd1-84f6-3b476d98748a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449763}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b8837dad-34d4-5dd1-84f6-3b476d98748a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449763} :answer-field/id #uuid "00d1f4c0-204e-570d-a62f-76800bbc9dc9" :answer-field/ke